    "chunk_size_bytes": 423,
    "chunk_text": "Actor Gamini Samarakoon passes away\n\nColombo, July 1 (Daily Mirror) - Popular stage, teledrama and film actor Gamini Samarakoon passed away today.\n\nSamarakoon became a household name for his memorable role in the stage drama 'Tharawo Igilethi'. He also appeared in several teledramas, including 'Tharadevi' and 'Eka Mawakage Daruwo'.\n\nIn addition to his stage and television career, he acted in the film 'Alu Yata Gindara'."
