    "chunk_text": "Gota\u2019s ex-private secretary remanded until 8 July over salary probe\n\nFormer President Gotabaya Rajapaksa\u2019s former private secretary, Sugeeshwara Bandara, was yesterday further remanded until 8 July by the Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court.\n\nBandara, who was produced before court yesterday, was arrested by the Central Crime Investigation Bureau (CCIB) on 18 June as part of an ongoing investigation into alleged irregularities involving Government salary payments.\n\nHe is accused of simultaneously drawing salaries from two separate Government institutions."
