    "md5": "70bcdcf8def6e04dabb5142eb6ebfb6f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1702,
    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Solar-PMF Finance expand access to solar energy\n\nIn a move aimed at accelerating solar adoption across Sri Lanka, Hayleys Solar has joined forces with PMF Finance PLC to provide accessible financing solutions that help the residential and commercial customers invest in clean energy with greater ease and confidence.\n\nThe partnership brings together Hayleys Solar\u2019s extensive expertise in renewable energy and PMF Finance\u2019s over 43 years of experience in Sri Lanka\u2019s financial services sector, creating a seamless pathway for the customers seeking to invest in sustainable energy solutions.\n\nThe customers will gain access to customised financing solutions designed to reduce the upfront cost of solar installations, enabling greater long-term savings on electricity bills while supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s transition towards a more sustainable and resilient energy future.\n\nHayleys Fentons Deputy Managing Director Energy Roshane Perera stated, \u201cThis partnership with PMF Finance marks an important step in our mission to make solar energy more accessible to a wider segment of society. By integrating flexible financing solutions with our renewable energy offerings, we are enabling more customers to confidently invest in clean energy while enjoying long-term financial and environmental benefits.\u201d\n\nPMF Finance Director and Chief Executive Officer Prof. (Dr.) Dewasiri N. Jayantha stated, \u201cWe are pleased to collaborate with Hayleys Solar in supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s transition towards sustainable energy. Through our financing solutions, we aim to make solar adoption more achievable for the customers by easing financial constraints and providing convenient repayment options.\u201d"
  },
