    "chunk_size_bytes": 1583,
    "chunk_text": "Majestic Electric transforms BOC Head Office with modern facade lighting system\n\nThe iconic Bank of Ceylon (BOC) Head Office building has been transformed with a state-of-the-art facade lighting system, enhancing its architectural presence and reinforcing its status as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most recognisable corporate landmarks.\n\nMajestic Electric Co. Ltd., successfully completed the project, which involved designing, supplying, and installing an advanced architectural lighting solution with the product and technical support provided by the LPA Team.\n\nThe new facade lighting system has been carefully designed to highlight the building\u2019s unique architectural features while providing an elegant and visually striking night time appearance.\n\nUtilising modern LED lighting technology, the system delivers exceptional energy efficiency, reliability, and flexibility. The lighting design allows for dynamic color-changing effects and customised lighting scenes, enabling the building to commemorate national celebrations, special events, and corporate milestones.\n\nMajestic Electric Co. CEO Jayamal Gunaratne said:\u00a0 \u201cThis project represents a significant achievement in architectural lighting design. Our objective was to create a visually appealing lighting solution that enhances the identity of the BOC Head Office while maintaining energy efficiency and long-term sustainability.\u201d\n\nThe BOC Head Office facade lighting project stands as a testament to innovation, technical excellence, and professional project execution, further elevating Colombo\u2019s night time skyline."
