    "description": "Phoenix of South Asia: Sri Lanka\u2019s stunning return to upper-middle-income status under AKD",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Phoenix-of-South-Asia-Sri-Lanka-s-stunning-return-to-upper-middle-income-status-under-AKD/4-794200",
