    "description": "Decline of Pax Americana: Empire, republic and the lessons of Rome \u2013 Part II",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Decline-of-Pax-Americana-Empire-republic-and-the-lessons-of-Rome-Part-II/4-794203",
