    "description": "Govt has ample funds to fast-track development projects: Minister Bimal Rathnayaka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Govt-has-ample-funds-to-fast-track-development-projects-Minister-Bimal-Rathnayaka/108-344726",
