    "chunk_size_bytes": 527,
    "chunk_text": "Perpetual Treasuries\u2019 business suspension extended\n\nThe Central Bank of Sri Lanka, acting in terms of the Regulations made under the Registered Stock and Securities Ordinance and the Local Treasury Bills Ordinance, has decided to extend the suspension of Perpetual Treasuries Limited (PTL) from carrying on the business and activities of a Primary Dealer for a further period of six months with effect from 4.30 p.m. on 05th July 2026, in order to continue the investigations being conducted by the Central Bank of Sri Lanka."
  },
