    "chunk_text": "Through a single, seamless digital experience, Dialog Pay makes it easier for customers to manage payments and financial services, encouraging digital payments to become a natural part of everyday life. Built on one of Sri Lanka\u2019s largest digitally enabled merchant ecosystems, Dialog Pay enables secure and convenient Lanka QR payments across more than 100,000 retail outlets spanning supermarkets, restaurants, fashion retailers, electronics stores, healthcare providers and thousands of neighbourhood businesses across Sri Lanka. Whether shopping for groceries, dining out or making everyday purchases, customers can enjoy the convenience of secure digital payments across the places they visit most, while enabling merchants to participate in Sri Lanka\u2019s growing digital economy."
