    "md5": "9972b426f4d86a079abe0bf53a2310cd",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1241,
    "chunk_text": "Kananathan congratulates Ethiopia\u201ds Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed on electoral victory\n\nFormer diplomat Ambassador Kananathan, who has maintained a close and long-standing relationship with Ethiopian Prime Minister and Chairman of the Prosperity Party Dr. Abiy Ahmed, has extended his heartfelt congratulations following the Prosperity Party\u2019s decisive victory in Ethiopia\u2019s parliamentary elections.\n\nIn his congratulatory message, former Ambassador Kananathan described Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed as one of Africa\u2019s most dynamic and visionary leaders, noting that the election results reflect the strong confidence and trust the Ethiopian people have placed in his leadership and in the Prosperity Party\u2019s steadfast commitment to safeguarding national interests, advancing sustainable development, and improving the well-being of all Ethiopians.\n\nKananathan expressed his confidence that, under Dr. Abiy Ahmed\u2019s continued leadership, Ethiopia will continue to build on its achievements and further strengthen its peace, stability, economic transformation, and regional influence.\n\nHe wished Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed good health, continued success, and every achievement in in leading Ethiopia toward greater prosperity and progress."
  },
