    "chunk_text": "The Offices at Cinnamon Life receives SL\u2019s 1st GreenRE Gold Certification\n\nThe Offices at Cinnamon Life by John Keells Properties has been awarded the Gold GreenRE Certification for Sustainable Real Estate Excellence in the Existing Non-Residential Category, marking a significant milestone for Sri Lanka\u2019s commercial real estate sector.\n\nThis is the first time GreenRE has awarded a green building rating to a development in Sri Lanka, further reinforcing Cinnamon Life\u2019s position as a benchmark for future-ready urban developments.\n\nThe Gold certification recognises the development\u2019s high standards in sustainability performance, energy efficiency and environmentally conscious design. It reflects a strong commitment towards creating workspaces that not only support modern business requirements but also prioritise long-term environmental responsibility and operational efficiency.\n\nEstablished in 2013 by Malaysia\u2019s Real Estate and Housing Developers Association, GreenRE promotes sustainability within the property sector through green building certification and rating systems, training and awareness programmes as well as research and development initiatives. The certification framework is recognised for encouraging responsible development practices that contribute towards more sustainable built environments across the region.\n\nStrategically located in the heart of Colombo as part of the larger City of Dreams integrated development, The Offices at Cinnamon Life offers a premium commercial environment that combines modern infrastructure with sustainability-focused design principles. The development integrates efficient building systems, optimised energy performance and environmentally conscious operational practices to create a healthier and more efficient workplace ecosystem."
