    "md5": "a144af4f58c50aa515f71062ab555352",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1816,
    "chunk_text": "The Global Economics Awards People\u2019s Insurance, Best General Insurance Company of the Year 2026\n\nStrengthens industry leadership through international recognition and outstanding sales excellence\n\nPeople\u2019s Insurance PLC has once again reaffirmed its position as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading general insurers through a prestigious international accolade and the continued recognition of exceptional performance within its sales force.\n\nIn a significant achievement, People\u2019s Insurance was named Best General Insurance Company of the Year 2026 \u2013 Sri Lanka, at The Global Economics Awards, a globally respected platform that recognises organisations demonstrating excellence in performance, governance, innovation and industry leadership. This marks the third consecutive year that the company has received this distinguished international recognition, underscoring its sustained commitment to operational excellence, customer-centric innovation and long-term value creation.\n\nThe recognition comes on the back of another strong financial performance during the first quarter of 2026. People\u2019s Insurance recorded a 34 percent growth in gross written premium (GWP) to Rs.2,856.54 million, outperforming the overall industry growth of 27 percent during the same period.\n\nProfit before tax increased to Rs.230.52 million, while profit after tax rose to Rs.156.40 million, representing an overall profitability growth of 18 percent year-on-year.\n\nDemonstrating its commitment to the customers, the company settled claims amounting almost to Rs.1 billion during the quarter.\n\nThe non-motor portfolio recorded an impressive growth of 25 percent, significantly exceeding the industry growth of 13 percent for the segment, reflecting the success of the company\u2019s diversification strategy and strong market presence."
