    "chunk_text": "The non-motor portfolio recorded an impressive growth of 25 percent, significantly exceeding the industry growth of 13 percent for the segment, reflecting the success of the company\u2019s diversification strategy and strong market presence.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Chairman Chandana Guniyangoda stated, \u201cReceiving the Best General Insurance Company of the Year 2026 \u2013 Sri Lanka award for the third consecutive year is a proud milestone for People\u2019s Insurance. This recognition reflects the strength of our strategic direction, sound governance practices and the unwavering commitment of our employees.\n\nOur continued growth and resilience in a competitive market demonstrate the confidence placed in us by our customers, business partners and stakeholders. As we move forward, we remain focused on strengthening our market leadership, delivering sustainable growth focusing on insurance inclusivity and creating lasting value for all stakeholders.\u201d\n\nChief Executive Officer Jeevani Kariyawasam added, \u201cThis recognition is a testament to the collective efforts of our entire team and reflects the strong foundation we have built through customer-centricity, operational excellence, disciplined underwriting and prudent risk management.\n\nOur first-quarter performance demonstrates the effectiveness of our growth strategy and our ability to consistently deliver strong results while maintaining financial stability. As we continue our journey, we remain committed to expanding insurance accessibility, embracing innovation, enhancing customer experiences and contributing meaningfully to the development of Sri Lanka\u2019s insurance industry.\u201d"
