    "description": "Oil palm deserves scientific assessment, not blanket condemnation: Professor",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Oil-palm-deserves-scientific-assessment-not-blanket-condemnation-Professor/273-344981",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
