    "chunk_text": "The government said that three major elephant corridors in the Hambantota and Monaragala districts\u2014Koholankala, Hadapanagala and Wetahirakanda\u2014have already been gazetted and opened under the programme.\n\nBuilding on that model, the government plans to implement a similar approach in Anuradhapura, where incidents related to the human-elephant conflict remain among the highest in the country."
