    "description": "Trump says interim accord to end war is \u2019over\u2019 after Iranian strikes",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Trump-says-interim-accord-to-end-war-is-over-after-Iranian-strikes/107-345078",
