    "description": "Beyond concrete: Sunela Jayewardene urges Sri Lanka to rediscover an ancient wisdom for a planet in peril",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/beyond-concrete-sunela-jayewardene-urges-sri-lanka-to-rediscover-an-ancient-wisdom-for-a-planet-in-peril/",
