    "chunk_text": "Perituza conducts insightful AI workshop for Sri Lanka\u2019s PR and Ad agencies\n\nPerituza, a Texas-based AI and application development consultancy firm, recently hosted an exclusive executive breakfast session titled \u201cApplying AI in Agency Workflows\u201d for senior leaders from Sri Lanka\u2019s public relations, communications, advertising, marketing and digital sectors.\n\nThe informative session formed part of Perituza\u2019s ongoing efforts to introduce practical AI capabilities, workflow automation solutions and digital transformation opportunities to organizations across the region. The initiative was supported by Solutions Ground in its capacity as a strategic business advisory and stakeholder engagement partner, helping convene senior leaders from across Sri Lanka\u2019s communications, marketing and agency sectors to facilitate dialogue around the opportunities and implications of AI for the industry.\n\nAs client expectations continue to evolve, agencies are increasingly being asked to provide services that extend beyond traditional communications, marketing and creative execution. Organizations today are looking for support in areas such as workflow automation, AI implementation, data intelligence, analytics, customer-facing digital experiences and business process optimization. Perituza believes this presents a significant opportunity for agencies to expand their service offerings, unlock new revenue streams and strengthen client relationships without necessarily building large technology teams internally.\n\nAllianz Annual Awards 2026 celebrates \u2018rare, regal and remarkable excellence in Sri Lanka\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
