    "description": "Aragalaya 4th Anniversary: \u2018Colour Revolution\u2019 or third post-Independence civic uprising?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Aragalaya-4th-Anniversary-Colour-Revolution-or-third-post-Independence-civic-uprising/4-794405",
