    "description": "Pan Asia Bank strengthens national remittance framework with \u2018Remit Max\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Pan-Asia-Bank-strengthens-national-remittance-framework-with-Remit-Max/273-345114",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
