    "description": "BYD\u2019s global leadership visits SL as brand deepens regional commitment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/BYDs-global-leadership-visits-SL-as-brand-deepens-regional-commitment/273-345117",
    "lang": "en",
