    "description": "KleenPark marks 38 years with the opening of \u2018Lakeside Detail\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/KleenPark-marks-38-years-with-the-opening-of-Lakeside-Detail/273-345119",
