    "time_ut": 1783570317.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-07-09-dailymirrorlk-42339893-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "5d336b143c9a8db8c0aa060eced3b5e7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2020,
    "chunk_text": "KleenPark marks 38 years with the opening of \u2018Lakeside Detail\u2019\n\nKleenPark marked two significant milestones on 22 June \u2014 its 38th anniversary and the opening of its newest detailing facility, \u201cLakeside Detail by KleenPark\u201d, at Cinnamon Lakeside Colombo.\n\nThe occasion was especially significant as KleenPark stands today as Sri Lanka\u2019s first fully employee-owned company in the automotive detailing industry.\n\nThe opening of this new outlet marks another important chapter in KleenPark\u2019s journey of innovation, service excellence, customer care, and continuous growth.\n\nStrategically located within a five-star hospitality setting, Lakeside Detail is designed to deliver world-class automotive detailing services, offering hotel guests, corporate clients, and vehicle owners the convenience of premium vehicle care while maintaining the exceptional standards of quality for which KleenPark has been renowned for nearly four decades.\n\nThe ceremonial opening was attended by the staff of KleenPark (Pvt) Ltd, the management of Cinnamon Lakeside Colombo, distinguished guests, valued customersand members of the KleenPark family. Addressing the gathering, KleenPark\u2019s management reflected on the company\u2019s remarkable journey, which began in 1988 with the vision of its Founder, Ranjan Ratnasena, who introduced professional automotive detailing to Sri Lanka.\n\nThe opening of Lakeside Detail represents more than just the launch of a new outlet; it symbolizes KleenPark\u2019s continued investment in elevating the standards of automotive care in Sri Lanka while creating greater convenience and value for customers. Operated by highly trained and internationally certified detailing professionals using modern detailing tools and equipment, the facility offers a comprehensive range of premium services, including express detailing, interior and exterior detailing, ceramic coating, paint protection film (PPF), nano-ceramic window films, customised floor mats, and other specialised vehicle care treatments."
  },
