    "chunk_text": "The opening of Lakeside Detail represents more than just the launch of a new outlet; it symbolizes KleenPark\u2019s continued investment in elevating the standards of automotive care in Sri Lanka while creating greater convenience and value for customers. Operated by highly trained and internationally certified detailing professionals using modern detailing tools and equipment, the facility offers a comprehensive range of premium services, including express detailing, interior and exterior detailing, ceramic coating, paint protection film (PPF), nano-ceramic window films, customised floor mats, and other specialised vehicle care treatments.\n\nWith a proud heritage, a unique employee-owned culture, and an unwavering commitment to quality, Lakeside Detail by KleenPark represents the next step in the company\u2019s vision to deliver world-class automotive detailing experiences to vehicle enthusiasts across Sri Lanka, while continuing to raise the standard of vehicle care for generations to come."
