    "description": "\u2018Prisoners are human beings:\u2019   The reality inside and outside the prison walls",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Prisoners-are-human-beings-The-reality-inside-and-outside-the-prison-walls/172-345143",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
