    "chunk_text": "House of underworld figure \u2019Thembili Lahiru\u2019 set ablaze in Middeniya\n\nColombo, July 9 (Daily Mirror) - The house of alleged underworld figure known as \"Thembili Lahiru\" was set on fire by an unidentified group in the Kudagalara area of Middeniya on Tuesday night (July 8), police said.\n\nAccording to police, Lahiru's mother was inside the house when the fire broke out but managed to escape without sustaining any injuries.\n\nThe cause and motive behind the suspected arson attack have not yet been determined."
