    "chunk_text": "Rupee hits Rs. 340 against USD\n\nThe Sri Lankan rupee weakened further against the US dollar yesterday, with the dollar\u2019s selling rate crossing the Rs. 340 mark, according to the latest daily exchange rates released by the Central Bank.\n\nThe Central Bank\u2019s daily exchange rate data showed the selling rate of the US dollar rose to Rs. 340.8686 on July 9, while the buying rate was recorded at Rs. 331.3476.\n\nOn the previous day, July 8, the US dollar\u2019s selling rate stood at Rs. 339.7382, with the buying rate at Rs. 330.2889."
