    "description": "ADB sees slower growth, higher inflation for  Sri Lanka through 2027",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/ADB-sees-slower-growth-higher-inflation-for-Sri-Lanka-through-2027/215-345233",
    "lang": "en",
