    "description": "From Vulnerability to Opportunity: AI and the Future of Work in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/From-Vulnerability-to-Opportunity-AI-and-the-Future-of-Work-in-Sri-Lanka/172-345236",
    "lang": "en",
