    "description": "2027 Budget to strengthen public healthcare to reduce private treatment costs: President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/2027-Budget-to-strengthen-public-healthcare-to-reduce-private-treatment-costs-President/34-794490",
    "lang": "en",
