    "chunk_text": "Intermittent rain, dense fog disrupt traffic in Central Hills\n\nColombo, July 10 (Daily Mirror) - Intermittent rain and dense fog have affected the western slopes of the Central Hills, disrupting traffic and reducing visibility on several main roads, police said.\n\nThe Nuwara Eliya Disaster Management Unit has urged motorists to exercise extreme caution and drive slowly due to poor visibility caused by dense fog.\n\nDrivers travelling on the Hatton\u2013Nuwara Eliya, Nuwara Eliya\u2013Welimada and Nuwara Eliya\u2013Gampola main roads have been advised to remain vigilant and adhere to safety precautions until weather conditions improve."
