    "chunk_text": "Missing repeater firearm recovered at Negombo Prison\n\nColombo, July 10 (Daily Mirror) - The repeater firearm that went missing following the recent clash at Negombo Prison has been recovered, the Department of Prisons said.\n\nThe department said the firearm was found within the prison premises after an extensive search.\n\nThe weapon had gone missing following the clash at the prison on July 6.\n\nMeanwhile, the Department of Prisons said steps will be taken in the coming days to accommodate inmates at the Old Bogambara Prison premises in Kandy.\n\nAn Extraordinary Gazette Notification has been issued to establish a new prison at the historic site as part of efforts to ease congestion in the prison system.\n\nAnatomy of the Negombo prison riot: Government should fix the prison system without delay\n\nGunshots account for 14 of 24 deaths in Negombo Prison clash\n\nNegombo Prison declared crime scene, no longer suitable to house inmates"
