    "description": "Ban all tobacco product sales to those born after 2010- SLMA tells President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Ban-all-tobacco-product-sales-to-those-born-after-2010-SLMA-tells-President/108-345319",
    "lang": "en",
