    "chunk_text": "Negombo Prison violence: Eight prison officers posthumously promoted\n\nColombo, July 10 (Daily Mirror) - The Department of Prisons has posthumously promoted the eight prison officers who were killed during the recent violence at the Negombo Prison.\n\nAccording to the Department, Second-Class Jailer S.H.S. Chandrawansa has been promoted to the rank of First-Class Jailer, while the remaining prison guards who lost their lives have been promoted to the rank of Sergeant.\n\nThe Negombo Prison violence claimed the lives of eight prison officers and 21 inmates.\n\nRemains of prison officers killed in clash brought to Welikada\n\nFinal respects paid to prison officers killed in Negombo prison violence\n\nGunshots account for 14 of 24 deaths in Negombo Prison clash"
