    "date_str": "2026-07-11",
    "description": "Our prisons are in need  of urgent reforms and funding",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Our-prisons-are-in-need-of-urgent-reforms-and-funding/172-345343",
