    "chunk_text": "BOC marks a new era in digital payments with Flex Tap & Pay\n\nBank of Ceylon (BOC) recently unveiled BOC Flex Tap & Pay, Sri Lanka\u2019s first mobile banking wallet-based tap and pay solution.\n\nLabour Minister and Finance and Planning Deputy Minister Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando\n\nBank of Ceylon General Manager and Chief Executive Officer Y.A. Jayathilaka\n\nBOC\u2019s esteemed customer and former Sri Lankan National Cricket Captain Mahela Jayawardena performs the very first BOC Flex Tap & Pay transaction, officially unveiling Sri Lanka\u2019s first mobile wallet with Tap & Pay.\n\nMastercard Country Manager Bangladesh, Bhutan, Maldives, Nepal and Sri Lanka Sandun Hapugoda was among the distinguished participants at the launch of BOC Flex Tap & Pay"
  },
