    "description": "Authorities reassure 2.5mn tourist arrival target with US $ 3.5bn revenue goal",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Authorities-reassure-2-5mn-tourist-arrival-target-with-US-3-5bn-revenue-goal/245-345357",
    "lang": "en",
