    "chunk_text": "The renewed partnership builds on a successful collaboration established in 2025, under which Dialog Enterprise served as the official Digital Technology Partner of NCE. Through this partnership, both organisations have worked closely to enhance the digital capabilities of Sri Lankan exporters by facilitating access to cutting-edge ICT solutions, knowledge-sharing initiatives, and technology-led business transformation programs. As part of the renewed collaboration, Dialog Enterprise will continue to support NCE and its membership base with a comprehensive portfolio of Digital Transformation tools including converged connectivity, cloud services, cybersecurity, data analytics, artificial intelligence, and Internet of Things (IoT) technologies. The partnership will also facilitate educational forums, industry workshops, and expert-led sessions designed to help exporters navigate evolving global market demands and accelerate their Digital Transformation journeys specially focusing on the Aspiring Exporters who are Small and Medium Entrepreneurs (SME).\n\nCommenting on the partnership, NCE Secretary General/CEO Shiham Marikar noted that the renewed collaboration will further strengthen the chamber\u2019s efforts to equip exporters with the knowledge, tools, and technologies required to thrive in an increasingly digital global economy.\n\nSpeaking on the partnership renewal, Dialog Enterprise Group Chief Officer Navin Pieris said that the continued collaboration with NCE underscores Dialog Enterprise\u2019s commitment to empowering Sri Lankan businesses with future-ready digital solutions that drive sustainable growth and global competitiveness.\n\nThrough this renewed partnership, Dialogue Enterprise and NCE will continue to work together to foster innovation, technology adoption, and digital excellence across Sri Lanka\u2019s export community, contributing towards the nation\u2019s broader economic growth and Digital Transformation agenda."
