    "md5": "0132c593d1d6acbaa2a470030f92bbbb",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1535,
    "chunk_text": "HRCSL says no conclusions reached as probe ongoing into Negombo prison violence, torture and deaths\n\nThe Human Rights Commission of Sri Lanka (HRCSL) has launched a wide-ranging investigation into the recent violence at Negombo Prison, including the deaths and injuries of inmates and prison officers, allegations of torture and ill-treatment of transferred prisoners, and the denial of access to Welikada Prison during an unannounced inspection, while stressing that no conclusions have yet been reached.\n\nIssuing a statement HRCSL said: The Human Rights Commission of Sri Lanka has launched an investigation into the recent violence at the Negombo Prison and subsequent events at other prisons. The key aspects of the investigation include the following:\n\n1. The circumstances that led to the violence at the Negombo Prison and the deaths and injuries of inmates and prison officers;\n\n2. The denial of access to the HRCSL at the Welikada Prison during its unannounced visit at approximately 8.30PM on 7 July 2026;\n\n3. Allegations of torture and other forms of ill-treatment of inmates who were transferred from the Negombo Prison to other prison facilities, and the circumstances of the deaths of two such inmates while in the custody of prison officials.\n\nThe Commission wishes to clarify that no conclusions have been drawn with respect to any of the abovementioned aspects of its investigation and that it is currently in the process of gathering evidence, including statements from inmates and officials, and evaluating the same."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-07-11-dailyftlk-eefd0608",
    "num": "dailyftlk-eefd0608",
    "date_str": "2026-07-11",
    "description": "HRCSL says no conclusions reached as probe ongoing into Negombo prison violence, torture and deaths",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/HRCSL-says-no-conclusions-reached-as-probe-ongoing-into-Negombo-prison-violence-torture-and-deaths/56-794530",
    "lang": "en",
