    "chunk_text": "Fire brigade emergency hotline unavailable; call 117\n\nColombo, July 11 (Daily Mirror) - The Fire and Rescue Department\u2019s emergency hotline is temporarily out of service, the authorities announced.\n\nMembers of the public are requested to contact the Disaster Management Centre\u2019s emergency hotline 117 to report any fire incidents until further notice.\n\nThe Disaster Management Centre said arrangements are being made to restore the Fire Brigade\u2019s emergency communication service as soon as possible."
