    "chunk_size_bytes": 1546,
    "chunk_text": "Hero-Abans Auto celebrates excellence at national convention\n\nHero-Abans Auto recently hosted its prestigious Partners\u2019 Convention at ITC Ratnadipa, Colombo, bringing together over two hundred sales dealers from across the island along with senior representatives from Abans and Hero MotoCorp India. Held on July 4th under the inspiring theme \u201cAccelerating Towards the Future,\u201d the event celebrated the brand\u2019s remarkable growth and strengthened commitment to transforming Sri Lanka\u2019s two-wheeler industry.\n\nThe convention highlighted the rapid progress Hero has achieved since its relaunch in Sri Lanka in April 2025 through its partnership with Abans Auto. As the world\u2019s No. 1 manufacturer of motorcycles and scooters, Hero MotoCorp has quickly established a strong presence in the local market, driven by its focus on quality, innovation, reliability, and customer satisfaction.\n\nAddressing the gathering, company representatives expressed confidence in the brand\u2019s future, emphasizing that Hero is more than just a two-wheeler manufacturer. It represents freedom, dependability, and outstanding performance, empowering riders to overcome barriers and embrace new opportunities with confidence. Through its expanding product portfolio and customer-centric approach, Hero aims to redefine the riding experience for Sri Lankan consumers.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
