    "description": "Spectre of the \u2019\u2019Deep State\u2019\u2019: Planned capture of the Judiciary by the Executive",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Spectre-of-the-Deep-State-Planned-capture-of-the-Judiciary-by-the-Executive/4-794552",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1783887197.0,
