    "description": "The SSCL Vs VAT threshold revision \u2013 The logic of indirect tax reform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-SSCL-Vs-VAT-threshold-revision-The-logic-of-indirect-tax-reform/4-794556",
