    "chunk_text": "Another significant outcome of the visit was the opportunity to showcase Sri Lanka as a trusted and strategic partner within the Indo-Pacific. Through direct dialogue with policymakers and business leaders, the delegation reinforced Sri Lanka\u2019s commitment to strengthening its investment climate, improving ease of doing business, supporting rule-of-law reforms and enhancing bilateral commercial cooperation.\n\nAmCham Sri Lanka remains committed to ensuring that the interests of its members continue to be represented through constructive dialogue with both the Government of Sri Lanka and the United States Government. The Chamber will continue to engage closely with its membership through industry consultations, policy roundtables and direct stakeholder engagement to ensure that Sri Lanka\u2019s private sector remains well represented in shaping the future of bilateral trade and investment relations."
