    "description": "Wire Group launches Intel Wire strategic intelligence business unit",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Wire-Group-launches-Intel-Wire-strategic-intelligence-business-unit/273-345440",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1783906399.0,
