    "md5": "62a0e971ea9ac8344c1a1e8f522b1e2c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1193,
    "chunk_text": "The launch comes as the local and multinational firms face the growing challenges from high-velocity digital narratives that spread rapidly across disparate digital communities, traditional news outlets and social platforms before leadership teams can effectively intervene.\n\n\u201cIn today\u2019s environment, reputation is shaped in real time, often before organisations are even aware of an issue,\u201d Wire Group Chairperson Ashan Kumar said in a statement, noting that the framework is built to enable faster risk anticipation and protect long-term stakeholder trust.\n\nIn addition to risk mitigation, the unit will provide broader corporate intelligence capabilities to support executive decision-making.\n\n\u201cWhat organisations need today is not just information but clarity,\u201d said Shamugarajah.\n\n\u201cWe go beyond conversations and translate complex information into actionable intelligence.\u201d\n\nThe expansion builds on WCCG\u2019s 15-year footprint in strategic public relations and crisis advisory, marking a shift toward sophisticated, insights-driven intelligence models designed for enterprises, consultancies and ventures operating within the world\u2019s most complex and high-growth economies."
