    "chunk_size_bytes": 1405,
    "chunk_text": "Customers benefit from 24/7 self-service supported by agent-assisted digital channels and can submit claims in under two minutes, with real-time tracking at every step. Extending beyond transactions, the initiative also introduces Clicklife Suwamaga+, an AI-powered wellness ecosystem offering nutrition tracking, activity monitoring, gamified health challenges, and CSR-linked health awareness, extending the role of financial protection seamlessly into customers\u2019 everyday lives.\n\nCommenting on the award, Senath Jayatilake, Director and Chief Executive Officer at Union Assurance, said, \u201cWe are honoured to receive this recognition for a second time, joining an elite group of global insurers that have earned the Celent Model Insurer award more than once. As the only Sri Lankan insurer ever recognised on this global stage, and now the only one to be recognised twice, this achievement reflects the strength of our capabilities measured against the very best in the world.\n\nHaving first been recognised in 2020 for transforming our core technology, and now in 2026 for transforming the customer experience, we have shown consistent excellence across the full arc of digital transformation. I commend our team for their dedication in consistently raising the bar, and reaffirm our commitment to shaping a more connected, accessible and customer centric insurance experience for all Sri Lankans.\u201d"
