    "description": "Tourism earnings top US$ 1.5bn in 1H as June registers softer dip under new methodology",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Tourism-earnings-top-US-1-5bn-in-1H-as-June-registers-softer-dip-under-new-methodology/273-345457",
    "lang": "en",
