    "description": "Indian tourists outspend some European visitors as Sri Lanka targets 75,000-100,000 monthly arrivals",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Indian-tourists-outspend-some-European-visitors-as-Sri-Lanka-targets-75-000-100-000-monthly-arrivals/273-345458",
