    "description": "\u201cSri Lanka is fast getting notorious for being the  scam capital  of the world\u201d - Samagi Janabalawegaya  MP Harsha de Silva",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Sri-Lanka-is-fast-getting-notorious-for-being-the-scam-capital-of-the-world-Samagi-Janabalawegaya-MP-Harsha-de-Silva/334-345468",
