    "md5": "de1b7f249800f99bb7d27bee309d8251",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 559,
    "chunk_text": "University of Visual and Performing Arts reopens\n\nColombo, July 13 (Daily Mirror) - The University of the Visual and Performing Arts in Colombo resumed its academic activities today (13) after the institution was temporarily closed for nearly two weeks due to a surge in dengue and viral fever cases.\n\nThe university had suspended academic activities from July 2 as a precautionary measure following the spread of dengue among students and staff.\n\nDuring the closure, authorities carried out extensive dengue control and sanitation measures across the campus."
