    "chunk_text": "One unforgettable night with Rajiv Sebastian\u2026in Dubai\n\nThe city\u2019s most awaited nostalgia night is around the corner, and it\u2019s going to be loud, lively, and full of heart.\n\nOn Saturday, 25th July, the legendary Rajiv Sebastian teams up with the SEVEN NOTES Live Band Dubai for an electrifying \u201870\u2019s Pop Hits & Baila Night\u2019 at the Mercure Hotel Dubai, Barsha Heights.\n\nIn fact, Rajiv Sebastian is a name that needs no introduction. His voice, his stage presence, his connection with the crowd\u2026 it\u2019s pure magic.\n\nFrom 8:00 PM till 3:00 AM, it\u2019s non-stop music, dancing, and memories that will take you straight to the golden era.\n\nYes, think classic 70\u2019s pop hits that defined a generation; think timeless Baila favourites that make you get up from your seat before the first note even finishes; think legendary songs you grew up singing in the car, at weddings, and on radio \u2014 all performed live, with energy that doesn\u2019t quit.\n\n\u201cGather your friends, reserve your table, and relive the golden era,\u201d says Niluk Uswaththa, of SEVEN NOTES fame.\n\n\u201cBring your family and join us for an unforgettable evening! Everyone is warmly invited\u2014young and old alike\u2014to sit together, enjoy the music, create beautiful memories, and experience a night full of entertainment.\u201d\n\nRajiv Sebastian: Hisvoice, his stage presence,his connectionwith the crowd\u2026 it\u2019spure magic\n\nBy the way, the SEVEN NOTES Live Band is made up of seven passionate musicians, who work by day, doing full-time jobs in Dubai, and by night they are live, on stage, producing high quality music. They\u2019ve shared the stage with many legendary artistes and backed some of the biggest names in the industry. For them, this isn\u2019t just a gig. It\u2019s love.\n\nI\u2019m told the entertainment scene, in Dubai, is almost back to normal, with a packed calendar of concerts, festivals and family events keeping the city alive through the summer of 2026.\n\nHowever, one is only hoping that the current Middle East crsis wouldn\u2019t suddenly escalate and change the setup in Dubai."
