    "date_str": "2026-07-14",
    "description": "Treating symptoms instead of causes: Why importing 7,500 workers will not solve construction industry crisis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Treating-symptoms-instead-of-causes-Why-importing-7-500-workers-will-not-solve-construction-industry-crisis/4-794600",
