    "chunk_text": "The Company also outlined its strategic priorities, including investments in digital transformation, expansion of its retail network, growth of the lubricants and petrochemical businesses, enhancement of operational efficiencies, and the pursuit of sustainable energy opportunities, including electric vehicle charging infrastructure and renewable energy projects through strategic partnerships.\n\nThe AGM also provided shareholders with an opportunity to engage directly with the Board through an interactive question-and-answer session covering key topics such as industry developments, fuel pricing, sustainability initiatives, business diversification, and the Company\u2019s outlook for the coming year.\n\nExpressing appreciation to shareholders, customers, employees, business partners, regulators, and all stakeholders, the Chairman reaffirmed Lanka IOC\u2019s commitment to maintaining the highest standards of corporate governance, delivering operational excellence, supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s energy security, and creating sustainable value for all stakeholders.\n\nAs Lanka IOC moves forward, the Company remains focused on strengthening its market leadership, accelerating its sustainability journey, and pursuing strategic growth opportunities that will contribute to Sri Lanka\u2019s economic development while delivering sustainable long-term returns to its shareholders."
