    "description": "JKCG Auto and Green EV join forces to build SL\u2019s most expansive EV charging network",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/JKCG-Auto-and-Green-EV-join-forces-to-build-SLs-most-expansive-EV-charging-network/273-345537",
    "lang": "en",
