    "md5": "0ad41983e6ca224e4d444964330adddf",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1746,
    "chunk_text": "Divine Marketing celebrates 7 years launching new products\n\nLalinda Gamage - District Secretary\u00a0 Gampaha, Rienzie Nanayakkara -\u00a0 Managing Director and Anthony\u00a0 Marcus - Director\n\nDivine Marketing (Pvt) Ltd, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s trusted names in the tissue products industry, celebrated its seventh anniversary recently, introducing two innovative new products.\n\nThe company has grown into a leading supplier serving households as well as offices, hotels, restaurants, hospitals, and other commercial establishments across the country. Over the past seven years, the company has earned a strong reputation for delivering reliable, premium-quality hygiene solutions.\n\nThe new products include a Multi Fold Paper Towel Dispenser System, specifically designed for institutional and commercial use, and \u2018Drywella\u2019, a premium range of naturally dried fruits produced using advanced processing technology that preserves the fruits\u2019 natural taste, nutritional value, and freshness. The Drywella range has been developed to meet the growing demand for healthy, high-quality food products in both local and international markets.\n\nThe anniversary celebration was graced by Gampaha District Secretary Lalinda Gamage as the Chief Guest, together with business partners, distributors, invited guests, and members of the company\u2019s staff.\n\nUnder the leadership of Managing Director Rivenshi Nanayakkara, Director Nimali Nanayakkara, and Director Anthony Marcus, Divine Marketing continues to invest in product innovation, superior quality, and environmentally responsible solutions that respond to evolving customer needs. The company remains committed to introducing internationally compliant products while delivering exceptional value and service."
  },
