    "description": "FTZMA seeks review of industrial diesel pricing; warns of competitiveness impact",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/FTZMA-seeks-review-of-industrial-diesel-pricing-warns-of-competitiveness-impact/273-345543",
