    "chunk_size_bytes": 730,
    "chunk_text": "Deadline set for school stationery grant process; No further extensions\n\nColombo, July 14 (Daily Mirror) - The Education Ministry has announced the deadlines for the 2026 programme to provide grants for the purchase of stationery for schoolchildren, stating that no further extensions will be granted.\n\nAccording to the announcement, beneficiary information must be entered by July 25, 2026, while the verification of beneficiary details must be completed by July 27, 2026.\n\nThe deadline for scanning vouchers has been set for August 30, 2026.\n\nThe Ministry said the deadlines are final and urged all relevant officials to complete the required procedures within the stipulated timeframe, as no further extensions will be granted."
