    "description": "EDB, IFC and EU strengthen export readiness of Eastern Province SMEs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/EDB-IFC-and-EU-strengthen-export-readiness-of-Eastern-Province-SMEs/273-345553",
    "lang": "en",
