    "description": "Quadruple murder accused acquitted after 16 years",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Quadruple-murder-accused-acquitted-after-16-years/108-345573",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
