    "description": "UAE condemns Iran\u2019s \u2019brazen\u2019 attack on tankers as US launches fresh strikes",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/UAE-condemns-Irans-brazen-attack-on-tankers-as-US-launches-fresh-strikes/107-345585",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
