    "chunk_size_bytes": 509,
    "chunk_text": "Prime Minister to attend Qatar\u2019s Father Emir\u2019s funeral: Nalinda\n\nColombo, July 14 (Daily Mirror) - Prime Minister Harini Amarasuriya will leave for Qatar tonight to attend the funeral of Qatar's Father Emir, His Highness Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa Al Thani, Cabinet spokesman Nalinda Jayatissa said today.\n\nHe told the weekly breifing to announce Cabinet decisions that a delegation will accompany the Prime Minister.\n\nThe Minister said a group representing the Opposition is also set to attend the funeral."
