    "chunk_text": "Dengue Quiz Sri Lanka: How Much Do You Really Know?\n\nJuly 14 (Daily Mirror) - Sri Lanka's dengue outbreak has reached epidemic levels this year. How much do you actually know about dengue symptoms, warning signs, and prevention? Take this quick quiz and find out.\n\nWith cases rising across the country, a few minutes spent testing your knowledge could make a real difference for both your household and your neighbourhood. Let's see how dengue-smart you really are.\n\nDengue remains a critical public health challenge across our island. Test your knowledge of monsoon patterns, local vector behaviors, clinical warning signs, and everyday preventive measures with this 10-question Sri Lankan awareness challenge.\n\nDailyMirror is making efforts to create awareness amongst its audience to help curb the dengue epidemic in Sri Lanka.\n\nThank you for taking part in this dengue awareness quiz. We hope it gave you something new to learn and something practical to act on, whether that's checking your home for breeding sites or knowing when to seek medical help. Share it with your family and neighbours, since dengue prevention in Sri Lanka works best when everyone plays a part.\n\nIf you haven't already, read our full guide on dengue symptoms, warning signs, and prevention in Sri Lanka"
