    "chunk_text": "This core focus is complemented by initiatives in community engagement, climate action and environmental protection, ensuring a balanced approach to sustainable growth. Aligned with SLFRS S2 and global best practices, First Capital champions programmes that promote inclusive progress, sustainable development and long-term well-being across Sri Lanka.\n\nAs a leading player in Sri Lanka\u2019s capital markets, First Capital recognises that long-term value creation is closely linked with environmental stewardship and strong governance. The verification of its GHG emissions marks a meaningful step in advancing the company\u2019s environmental, social and governance (ESG) agenda and reinforces its contribution towards building a more sustainable financial ecosystem.\n\nFirst Capital Holdings Head of Sustainability and Corporate Reporting Diluni Danushika said, \u201cThis verification reflects our commitment to transparent environmental reporting, accountability and continuous improvement. As a responsible investment institution, we recognise that creating long-term value requires strong environmental stewardship and governance.\u201d\n\nThis recognition further strengthens the stakeholder confidence in First Capital\u2019s ESG governance framework, underscoring its commitment to measurable environmental accountability and transparent reporting."
